e decorations are visible in the background, suggesting a casual, festive atmosphere.\n- **Ambiance:** The scene is bright and sunny, with natural light illuminating the table and the food, enhancing the visual appeal of the meal.\n\n---\n\n**Overall Impression:**\nThe man is enthusiastically enjoying a large, freshly prepared spiny lobster in a picturesque, tropical setting. His actions are focused on the tactile and gustatory experience of eating the lobster, from extracting the meat to savoring each bite. The setting and his expressive demeanor contribute to the overall vibe of a relaxed, adventurous, and culturally immersive culinary experience in the Bahamas."}], 'formatted_responses': ["\n=== Batch 0-12 (12 frames) ===\nFrames: /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/evYm0cELO3I/frames/frame_0549.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/evYm0cELO3I/frames/frame_0550.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/evYm0cELO3I/frames/frame_0551.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/evYm0cELO3I/frames/frame_0556.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/evYm0cELO3I/frames/frame_0557.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/evYm0cELO3I/frames/frame_0558.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/evYm0cELO3I/frames/frame_0560.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/evYm0cELO3I/frames/frame_0561.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/evYm0cELO3I/frames/frame_0563.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/evYm0cELO3I/frames/frame_0567.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/evYm0cELO3I/frames/frame_0568.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/evYm0cELO3I/frames/frame_0569.jpg\nVLM Response: Based on the detailed analysis of the 12 provided frames, here is a comprehensive description of the man's actions, the food he is handling, and the setting:\n\n---\n\n**The Man:**\nThe man is wearing a colorful plaid shirt (pink, blue, and white) and a distinctive white headband with a printed graphic of a lobster on it. He is seated at a wooden table