as indicated by the global summary. Key elements include:\n- **Architecture:** A white building with shutters and a yellow wall in the background.\n- **Furniture:** Colorful blue and yellow chairs and tables, adding to the tropical, relaxed vibe.\n- **Decor:** String lights or festive decorations are visible in the background, suggesting a casual, festive atmosphere.\n- **Ambiance:** The scene is bright and sunny, with natural light illuminating the table and the food, enhancing the visual appeal of the meal.\n\n---\n\n**Overall Impression:**\nThe man is enthusiastically enjoying a large, freshly prepared spiny lobster in a picturesque, tropical setting. His actions are focused on the tactile and gustatory experience of eating the lobster, from extracting the meat to savoring each bite. The setting and his expressive demeanor contribute to the overall vibe of a relaxed, adventurous, and culturally immersive culinary experience in the Bahamas.\n"], 'condensed_response': '**Scene Summary (Frames\u202f0549‑0569)**  \n\n| Frame | Key Visuals & Action (character‑centric) |\n|-------|-------------------------------------------|\n| **0549** | Man in pink‑blue‑white plaid shirt and white lobster‑logo headband sits at a wooden table, a large red‑orange spiny lobster on a white platter (on a green banana leaf). |\n| **0550** | He grips the lobster tail with his left hand, uses a fork in his right hand to lift out the bright white meat. |\n| **0551** | Same hand‑position; a side of fried plantain chips and a small green cocktail are visible in the background. |\n| **0556** | He pulls a tail segment apart, exposing more meat; his face shows focused attention. |\n| **0557** | Fork now holds a chunk of lobster meat; he brings it toward his mouth. |\n| **0558** | Takes a bite, eyes briefly closed in enjoyment. |\n| **0560** | Smiles, looking directly at the camera, as he chatters (likely describing the taste). |\n| **0561** | Gestures with both hands, still holding the lobster piece, indicating “very tasty.” |\n| **0563** | Continues talking; the lobster plate remains largely intact, with a few pieces left. |\n| **0567** | The camera captures a wide view of the patio – white‑washed wall, yellow shutters, blue‑yellow chairs, string lights overhead. |\n| **0568** | He leans back, still smiling, a glass of green cocktail beside him. |\n| **0569** | Final frame: the man waves a hand in farewell, the lobster platter now mostly cleared. |\n\n**Overall Narrative**  \nA man dressed in a colorful plaid shirt and a lobster‑decorated headband sits at an outdoor tropical patio (likely in the Bahamas). Over twelve consecutive frames he progressively extracts, eats, and comments on a large spiny lobster served on a banana leaf, accompanied by fried plantains, a light salad, and a green cocktail. His demeanor shifts from focused eating to expressive enjoyment, culminating in a friendly, camera‑directed farewell. The setting is bright, sunny, and festively decorated with string lights, blue‑yellow furniture, and a white‑shuttered façade.', 'failed_images': []}}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': '{\n    "tool": "RECORD",\n    "entries": [\n        "Time: 549 seconds, Event: Man in plaid shirt and lobster headband extracts lobster meat with fork",\n        "Time: 550 seconds, Event: Man grips lobster tail with left hand, uses fork in right hand to lift out white meat",\n        "Time: 556 seconds, Event: Man pulls lobster tail segment apart, exposing more meat",\n        "Time: 557 seconds, Event: Man holds chunk of lobster meat on fork, brings it toward mouth",\n        "Time: 558 seconds, Event: Man takes bite of lobster meat, eyes closed in enjoyment",\n        "Time: 560 seconds, Event: Man smiles and looks directly at camera while talking about the lobster",\n        "Time: 561 seconds, Event: Man gestures with both hands while holding lobster piece, indicating enjoyment",\n        "Time: 563 seconds, Event: Man continues talking while lobster plate remains largely intact",\n        "Time: 567 seconds, Event: Wide view shows outdoor patio setting with colorful furniture",\n        "Time: 568 seconds, Event: Man leans back smiling with green cocktail beside him",\n        "Time: 569 seconds, Event: Man waves hand in farewell, lobster platter mostly cleared"\n    ]\n}'}, {'role': 'system', 'content': 'Successfully recorded 11 event(s). You now have 11 total recorded events. Use VIEW_RECORDS to see all of them sorted by time.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Looking at the question "What does the man do from 28:43-29:14?", I need to convert this time range to seconds and examine the specific frames. \n\n28:43 = 28 minutes * 60 + 43 seconds = 1723 seconds\n29:14 = 29 minutes * 60 + 14 seconds = 1754 seconds\n\nI need to examine frames 1723-1754 to see what the man is doing during this specific time period. Let me query these frames directly.\n\n```json\n{\n    "tool": "VLM_QUERY",\n    "frames": ["frames/frame_1723.jpg", "frames/frame_1724.jpg", "frames/frame_1725.jpg", "frames/frame_1726.jpg", "frames/frame_1727.jpg", "frames/frame_1728.jpg", "frames/frame_1729.jpg", "frames/frame_1730.jpg", "frames/frame_1731.jpg", "frames/frame_1732.jpg", "frames/frame_1733.jpg", "frames/frame_1734.jpg", "frames/frame_1735.jpg", "frames/frame_1736.jpg", "frames/frame_1737.jpg", "frames/frame_1738.jpg", "frames/frame_1739.jpg", "frames/frame_1740.jpg", "frames/frame_1741.jpg", "frames/frame_1742.jpg", "frames/frame_1743.jpg", "frames/frame_1744.jpg", "frames/frame_1745.jpg", "frames/frame_1746.jpg", "frames/frame_1747.jpg", "frames/frame_1748.jpg", "frames/frame_1749.jpg", "frames/frame_1750.jpg", "frames/frame_1751.jpg", "frames/frame_1752.jpg", "frames/frame_1753.jpg", "frames/frame_1754.jpg"],\n    "prompt": "Describe in detail what the man is doing in these frames. Is he cooking or tasting/eating? What specific food item is he handling? Is it conch or lobster? Describe his actions, the food, and the setting. Pay special atten